    "name": "Gluten Free Pizza Dough",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Vegan and gluten-free, take-n-bake pizza dough. As a dedicated gluten-free facility in Eugene, OR, their products are&nbsp;crafted without wheat,, making them safe for those with allergies while focusing on high-quality ingredients for a, convenient, and delicious, at-home pizza experience. Shelf life of 7 days in the fridge.</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Ingredients: Flour Blend (almond meal, potato starch, sweet rice, cornstarch, tapioca starch, sorghum, arrowroot powder, Xanthan gum, flaxseed meal, Sea salt, cream of tartar) , water, cane sugar, Olive oil, yeast</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Contains: Almond</span></p>",
